<title>DUBAI: Dubai silver re-exports to India fall in December.</title>
<headline>Dubai silver re-exports to India fall in December.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Re-exports of silver from Dubai to India slipped to 48.46 tonnes in December from 57.63 tonnes in November, statistics compiled from Dubai Customs showed.</p>
<p>Dubai is a major supplier of silver and gold to India -- the world's single largest gold market.</p>
<p>Re-exports to Saudi Arabia totalled 1.45 tonnes in December.</p>
</text>
